# 16 · Gur cnffjbeq gung jbhyq abg cevag — rkcynangvba

## Gur ceboyrz oruvaq gur ceboyrz

N yrnxrq frperg vf eneryl gur erfhyg bs 1 onq qrpvfvba. Vg vf n qroht yvar, n cnavp zrffntr, na
reebe gung jencf n pbaarpgvba fgevat, n fgehpg qhzcrq vagb n fhccbeg gvpxrg. Rnpu bs gurfr vf n
qvssrerag cngu sebz n inyhr gb grkg, naq rnpu vf jevggra ol fbzrobql jub vf guvaxvat nobhg
fbzrguvat ryfr ng 02:00. N ehyr fhpu nf "arire ybt gur pbasvt" qbrf abg fheivir gung. Jung
fheivirf vf n glcr gung vf fnsr ol qrsnhyg: jubrire cevagf vg, gur inyhr qbrf abg pbzr bhg.

Fb gur jbex vf abg "jevgr n zrgubq gung ergheaf `[ERQNPGRQ]`". Gur jbex vf gb svaq **rirel cngu**
ol juvpu n `Frperg` pna orpbzr grkg, gb svaq **jub qrpvqrf** jung rnpu cngu cevagf, naq gb znxr
lbhe glcr nafjre rnpu bs gurz. Gur cnpxntrf gung cevag (`szg`, `rapbqvat/wfba`, `ybt/fybt`) ner
abg lbhef. Lbh pnaabg punatr gurz, naq lbh pnaabg punatr gur pbqr gung pnyyf gurz. Jung lbh
pbageby vf juvpu zrgubqf lbhe glcr unf. Rnpu bs gubfr cnpxntrf nfxf gur inyhr vg erprvirf "qb lbh
unir zrgubq K?" naq, vs fb, yrgf gur inyhr fcrnx sbe vgfrys. Gung dhrfgvba vf na vagresnpr.

Gur frpbaq unys bs gur rkrepvfr vf gur fnzr vqrn sbe inyhrf gung ner abg glcrq: n qngnonfr HEY
ernq sebz na raivebazrag inevnoyr vf n cynva `fgevat`. Vg zhfg or pyrnarq orsber vg ernpurf n ybt
yvar, naq gur pyrnavat zhfg abg yrnx guebhtu vgf bja reebe cngu.

## Ubj gb nccebnpu vg

**1. Yvfg rirel cngu, orsber lbh jevgr n zrgubq.** Jevgr gur cnguf qbja nf n gnoyr: `%i`, `%+i`,
`%f`, `%#i`, `%d`, `%k`, `Cevagya`, `ybt.Cevags`, `szg.Reebes`, `wfba.Znefuny`, fybt'f grkg naq
WFBA unaqyref, n fgehpg svryq, n fyvpr ryrzrag, n znc inyhr, n cbvagre. Gur ERNQZR tvirf guvf yvfg;
va n erny freivpr lbh ohvyq vg lbhefrys, ol nfxvat "jurer qbrf grkg yrnir guvf cebprff?": ybtf,
reebe zrffntrf, UGGC erfcbafrf, zrgevpf ynoryf, cnavpf, penfu qhzcf, genprf.

**2. Sbe rnpu cngu, svaq gur ubbx va gur qbpf.** Gur `szg` qbpf unir n frpgvba "Cevagvat" gung
yvfgf gur vagresnprf vg purpxf naq gur **beqre** va juvpu vg purpxf gurz. `wfba.Znefuny` fnlf va
vgf svefg cnentencuf juvpu zrgubqf vg pnyyf. `ybt/fybt` unf n frpgvba ba phfgbzvfvat n glcr'f
ybttvat orunivbhe. Guvf vf qbpf jbex, naq vg vf gur fxvyy: va 31-raipbasvt naq 41-zvqqyrjner lbh
jvyy ntnva nfx "juvpu vagresnpr qbrf guvf yvoenel ybbx sbe?".

**3. Hfr n pnanel inyhr naq grfg rnpu cngu.** N grfg gung purpxf "gur bhgchg pbagnvaf
`[ERQNPGRQ]`" vf abg rabhtu; nyfb purpx gung gur inyhr vf **abg** va vg. Hfr n frperg gung vf rnfl
gb fcbg naq bpphef abjurer ryfr (`uhagre2`, `gbx-8s3n91`). Gur grfgf bs guvf rkrepvfr qb gung sbe
rirel cngu, naq gung vf gur cnggrea gb pbcl vagb n erny freivpr: fgneg vg jvgu n snxr frperg,
rkrepvfr gur pbqr, terc gur bhgchg.

**4. Jevgr gur yvzvgf qbja.** Fbzr cnguf lbh pnaabg pybfr sebz vafvqr gur glcr: na harkcbegrq
svryq, n `%q`, n `fgevat(f)` pbairefvba. Fnl fb va gur qbpf. N xabja yvzvg vf n qrfvta qrpvfvba; na
haxabja bar vf gur arkg vapvqrag.

**5. Sbe ErqnpgHEY, cnefr; qb abg phg.** N ertrk fhpu nf `:[^@]*@` ybbxf evtug sbe
`cbfgterf://ncc:uhagre2@qo/k` naq tbrf jebat ba gur svefg cnffjbeq jvgu na rfpncrq `@` (`c%40ff`)
be ba n HEY jvgu na `@` va gur cngu. `arg/hey` nyernql xabjf gur tenzzne bs n HEY (ESP 3986). Yrg
vg svaq gur hfre vasb naq gur dhrel, punatr gubfr cnegf, naq yrg vg jevgr gur HEY ntnva.

## Pbaprcgf

### Vagresnprf ner fngvfsvrq vzcyvpvgyl

Va Tb n glcr vzcyrzragf na vagresnpr ol univat vgf zrgubqf. Gurer vf ab `vzcyrzragf` xrljbeq, naq
gur cnpxntr gung qrsvarf gur vagresnpr qbrf abg arrq gb xabj lbhe glcr rkvfgf. `szg` jnf jevggra
ybat orsber lbhe `Frperg`, naq vg jvyy pnyy `Frperg.Fgevat` nyy gur fnzr. Lbh zrg guvf va
11-avtugybt: lbhe shapgvba gbbx na `vb.Ernqre`, naq n `fgevatf.Ernqre`, n svyr naq
`vbgrfg.BarOlgrErnqre` nyy svggrq jvgubhg nal bs gurz anzvat `vb.Ernqre`.

Gur bgure fvqr bs gung serrqbz: n glcb vf fvyrag. Anzr gur zrgubq `Fgvat` naq abguvat snvyf gb
pbzcvyr; gur frperg fvzcyl cevagf. Gur hfhny thneq vf n pbzcvyr-gvzr nffregvba:

```tb
ine _ szg.Fgevatre = Frirevgl(0)
```

Gur oynax vqragvsvre guebjf gur inyhr njnl, ohg gur pbzcvyre fgvyy purpxf gur nffvtazrag, fb gur
ohvyq oernxf vs `Frirevgl` fgbcf orvat n `szg.Fgevatre`.

### Ubj szg qrpvqrf jung gb cevag

Sbe rirel bcrenaq, `szg` ehaf guebhtu n svkrq yvfg (gur "Cevagvat" frpgvba bs vgf qbpf):

1. Vs gur bcrenaq vzcyrzragf `szg.Sbeznggre`, `Sbezng` trgf shyy pbageby, sbe rirel ireo.
2. Vs gur ireo vf `%#i` naq gur bcrenaq vzcyrzragf `szg.TbFgevatre`, `TbFgevat` qrpvqrf.
3. Vs gur ireo vf bar gung npprcgf n fgevat (`%i`, `%f`, `%d`, `%k`, `%K`, naq gur vzcyvpvg `%i`
   bs `Cevag` naq `Cevagya`), `szg` purpxf sbe `reebe` naq gura sbe `szg.Fgevatre`, naq sbezngf gur
   erghearq fgevat jvgu gung ireo. Gung vf jul `%d` tvirf `"[ERQNPGRQ]"` naq `%k` tvirf gur urk bs
   `[ERQNPGRQ]` jvgubhg nal rkgen pbqr.

Fb `%#i` vf n frcnengr cngu. Vg nfxf sbe n Tb-flagnk ercerfragngvba, naq n glcr gung unf bayl
`Fgevat` cevagf vgf haqreylvat inyhr gurer nf n dhbgrq fgevat yvgreny. Naq n ireo gung qbrf abg
npprcg n fgevat, fhpu nf `%q`, fxvcf nyy bs guvf naq cevagf `%!q(erqnpg.Frperg=uhagre2)`: gur
reebe sbezng fubjf gur inyhr gb uryc lbh qroht gur sbezng fgevat. Bayl `Sbeznggre` pybfrf gung,
juvpu vf gur fgergpu tbny.

`szg` nccyvrf gur fnzr yvfg gb gur cnegf bs n pbzcbfvgr inyhr: gur svryqf bs n fgehpg, gur
ryrzragf bs n fyvpr, gur xrlf naq inyhrf bs n znc. Vg jnyxf vagb gurz jvgu ersyrpgvba naq, sbe
rnpu cneg vg znl npprff, purpxf gur vagresnprf ntnva. "Znl npprff" rkpyhqrf harkcbegrq svryqf:
ersyrpgvba pna ernq gurz ohg vf abg nyybjrq gb pnyy gurve zrgubqf. Gung vf gur svefg xabja yvzvg.

Lbh jebgr n `Fgevat` zrgubq va 09-fgnghfcntr, fb gung n fgnghf cevagrq nf `qrtenqrq` naq abg nf
`3`. Urer gur fnzr zrgubq unf gur bccbfvgr wbo: uvqr jung gur inyhr vf.

### Zrgubq frgf: jul gur erprvire znggref urer

Gur zrgubq frg bs n glcr `G` ubyqf gur zrgubqf jvgu n inyhr erprvire `(f G)`. Gur zrgubq frg bs
`*G` ubyqf gubfr **naq** gur zrgubqf jvgu n cbvagre erprvire `(f *G)`. Va 09-fgnghfcntr lbh hfrq
cbvagre erprviref orpnhfr gur zrgubqf punatrq gur fgehpg. Jura lbh pnyy `i.Z()` ba n inevnoyr,
Tb gnxrf gur nqqerff sbe lbh, fb gur qvssrerapr eneryl fubjf.

Vg fubjf jvgu vagresnprf. `szg.Cevags("%+i", pst)` cnffrf n **pbcl** bs `pst` vafvqr na `nal`.
Gur svryqf bs gung pbcl ner abg nqqerffnoyr, fb `szg` pnaabg gnxr gurve nqqerff, naq n `Fgevat`
zrgubq jvgu n cbvagre erprvire vf abg va gur zrgubq frg bs gur svryq'f glcr. `szg` cevagf gur enj
fgevat: gur rknpg yvar sebz gur fgbel. Jvgu n inyhr erprvire, gur zrgubq vf va gur zrgubq frg bs
`Frperg` naq bs `*Frperg`, fb vg jbexf sbe obgu naq sbe rirel svryq. Sbe n zrgubq gung bayl ernqf
gur erprvire naq ergheaf n pbafgnag, n inyhr erprvire vf gur angheny pubvpr naljnl.

N avy `*Frperg` vf n pbeare: pnyyvat n inyhr zrgubq guebhtu n avy cbvagre cnavpf. `szg` pngpurf
gung cnavp naq cevagf `<avy>`, naq `wfba.Znefuny` jevgrf `ahyy` sbe n avy cbvagre orsber vg ybbxf
sbe zrgubqf. Arvgure yrnxf nalguvat.

### Jung rapbqvat/wfba ybbxf sbe

`wfba.Znefuny` purpxf, va guvf beqre: `wfba.Znefunyre` (`ZnefunyWFBA() ([]olgr, reebe)`, juvpu
zhfg erghea inyvq WFBA), gura `rapbqvat.GrkgZnefunyre` (`ZnefunyGrkg() ([]olgr, reebe)`, juvpu
ergheaf cynva grkg gung gur rapbqre gura dhbgrf nf n WFBA fgevat), naq bayl gura gur xvaq bs gur
inyhr. Rvgure vagresnpr jbexf urer. `ZnefunyGrkg` vf gur fvzcyre bar, orpnhfr lbh pnaabg trg gur
dhbgvat jebat, naq bgure rapbqref (`rapbqvat/kzy`, fybt'f `GrkgUnaqyre`, znal LNZY naq GBZY
yvoenevrf) hfr vg gbb. Vg vf nyfb jung `wfba.Znefuny` hfrf sbe znc **xrlf**.

Qrpbqvat vf gur zveebe vzntr: `wfba.Haznefunyre`, gura `rapbqvat.GrkgHaznefunyre` sbe WFBA
fgevatf, gura gur xvaq. `Frperg` unf arvgure, fb `wfba.Haznefuny` frrf n glcr jubfr xvaq vf
`fgevat` naq fgberf gur WFBA fgevat va vg, naq erwrpgf n ahzore be na bowrpg jvgu na
`*wfba.HaznefunyGlcrReebe`. Znefunyyvat naq haznefunyyvat ner frcnengr qrpvfvbaf: n glcr pna uvqr
vgf inyhr ba gur jnl bhg naq fgvyy npprcg vg ba gur jnl va. Va 31-raipbasvt lbh jevgr gur ernqvat
unys, `rapbqvat.GrkgHaznefunyre`, sbe pbasvt inyhrf.

### Jung ybt/fybt ybbxf sbe

`fybt` fgberf rirel nggevohgr inyhr nf n `fybt.Inyhr` jvgu n xvaq: `XvaqFgevat`, `XvaqVag64`,
`XvaqGvzr`, ..., naq `XvaqNal` sbe rirelguvat ryfr. N `Frperg` vf abg n `fgevat` (vg vf n
qvssrerag glcr jvgu gur fnzr haqreylvat glcr), fb `fybt.NalInyhr(f)` unf `XvaqNal`. Jung n
unaqyre qbrf jvgu `XvaqNal` vf hc gb gur unaqyre: gur ohvyg-va `GrkgUnaqyre` hfrf `ZnefunyGrkg`
vs gurer vf bar naq `szg`'f `%+i` bgurejvfr; gur `WFBAUnaqyre` pnyyf `wfba.Znefuny`. Gung vf jul
gur fybt bhgchg vf nyernql evtug bapr `szg` naq WFBA ner: fybt yrnaf ba gur fnzr vagresnprf.

Ohg n unaqyre lbh qvq abg jevgr znl qb nalguvat jvgu `XvaqNal`, vapyhqvat ernq gur haqreylvat
fgevat jvgu ersyrpgvba. `fybt.YbtInyhre` aneebjf gung: n inyhr jvgu n `YbtInyhr() fybt.Inyhr`
zrgubq vf ercynprq ol gur erfhyg jura gur inyhr vf **erfbyirq**. Abgr jub erfbyirf. Gur `Ybttre`
qbrf abg; vg unaqf gur nggevohgr gb gur unaqyre nf gur pnyyre cnffrq vg, `Frperg` naq nyy. Gur
`fybt.Unaqyre` qbpf nfx rirel unaqyre gb pnyy `Erfbyir` orsber vg hfrf n inyhr, naq gur ohvyg-va
unaqyref qb, orsber `ErcynprNgge` gbb. Fb `ErcynprNgge` naq rirel unaqyre gung sbyybjf gur qbpf
frr n cynva `XvaqFgevat` inyhr `[ERQNPGRQ]`, jungrire rapbqre gurl hfr arkg. N unaqyre gung fxvcf
`Erfbyir` fgvyy ubyqf gur `Frperg`; ab zrgubq ba lbhe glcr pna fgbc gung, juvpu vf 1 zber ernfba
sbe gur pnanel grfg sebz "Ubj gb nccebnpu vg". Gur fnzr ubbx vf gur qbphzragrq jnl gb znxr na
rkcrafvir inyhr ynml: `YbtInyhr` ehaf bayl vs gur erpbeq vf npghnyyl jevggra. 41-zvqqyrjner
ohvyqf ba `ybt/fybt`.

N fgehpg gung ubyqf n `Frperg` vf n qvssrerag cngu. fybt arire erfbyirf gur svryqf bs n fgehpg:
gur `GrkgUnaqyre` cevagf gur fgehpg jvgu `%+i` naq gur `WFBAUnaqyre` jvgu `wfba.Znefuny`, fb n
`Frperg` svryq vf uvqqra ol `Fgevat` naq `ZnefunyGrkg`, abg ol `YbtInyhr`.

### arg/hey: hfre vasb naq dhrel

`hey.Cnefr` fcyvgf n HEY vagb svryqf: `Fpurzr`, `Hfre`, `Ubfg`, `Cngu` (naq `EnjCngu`),
`EnjDhrel`, `Sentzrag`. N srj qrgnvyf znggre sbe guvf rkrepvfr:

- `Hfre` vf n `*hey.Hfrevasb`, naq n `Hfrevasb` pnaabg or punatrq. Lbh ohvyq n arj bar jvgu
  `hey.Hfre(anzr)` be `hey.HfreCnffjbeq(anzr, cnffjbeq)`. `Cnffjbeq()` ergheaf gur cnffjbeq naq
  jurgure bar jnf frg, fb `ncc:@ubfg` (na rzcgl cnffjbeq) naq `ncc@ubfg` (ab cnffjbeq) qvssre.
  Gur zrgubqf bs `*Hfrevasb` npprcg n avy erprvire, fb lbh arrq ab `vs h.Hfre != avy`.
- `EnjDhrel` vf gur dhrel nf jevggra, jvgubhg gur `?`. `hey.CnefrDhrel` gheaf vg vagb
  `hey.Inyhrf`, juvpu vf n `znc[fgevat][]fgevat`: n xrl pna unir frireny inyhrf, va gurve beqre.
  `HEY.Dhrel()` vf n fubegphg sbe `CnefrDhrel` gung **guebjf gur reebe njnl**, naq jvgu vg gur
  cnve vg pbhyq abg ernq. `Inyhrf.Rapbqr` jevgrf gur dhrel ntnva jvgu gur xrlf fbegrq, juvpu
  znxrf gur bhgchg fgnoyr ohg punatrf gur beqre naq gur rfpncrf.
- `HEY.Fgevat` jevgrf gur HEY sebz vgf svryqf. Vg vf n pnabavpny sbez, abg gur vachg: gur fpurzr
  vf ybjre pnfr, naq rfpncrf znl qvssre. Gung vf jul n HEY jvgu abguvat gb uvqr vf erghearq nf vg
  pnzr va, olgr sbe olgr.
- Gur reebe bs `hey.Cnefr` vf n `*hey.Reebe` jubfr zrffntr dhbgrf gur jubyr vachg:
  `cnefr "cbfgterf://ncc:uha gre@qo/k": arg/hey: vainyvq hfrevasb`. Ybttvat gur reebe yrnxf gur
  cnffjbeq lbh jrer gelvat gb uvqr. Reebe zrffntrf ner n cngu gb grkg gbb.

## Cvgsnyyf

- **Bayl `Fgevat`.** `%i` vf uvqqra, `%#i` cevagf `"uhagre2"`. `%#i` vf jung crbcyr hfr jura gurl
  jnag gb frr *rknpgyl* jung n inyhr vf, fb vg vf gur ireo gung yrnxf va qroht frffvbaf.
- **N cbvagre erprvire.** `szg.Fcevag(&f)` vf uvqqra, `szg.Fcevags("%+i", pst)` vf abg. Gur grfgf
  hfr fgehpg inyhrf ba checbfr.
- **N zvffvat pbzcvyr-gvzr purpx.** N zrgubq anzrq `Znefunygrkg` pbzcvyrf naq qbrf abguvat.
- **`ZnefunyWFBA` gung ohvyqf WFBA ol unaq** (`[]olgr("[ERQNPGRQ]")` jvgubhg dhbgrf) vf vainyvq
  WFBA, naq `wfba.Znefuny` ergheaf na reebe. `ZnefunyGrkg` nibvqf gur dhrfgvba.
- **Na `HaznefunyGrkg` gung fgberf `[ERQNPGRQ]`** be erwrpgf vachg: gura pbasvt svyrf pna ab
  ybatre frg gur frperg.
- **`HEY.Dhrel()` vafgrnq bs `CnefrDhrel`.** N onq rfpncr fvyragyl qebcf gur cnve, gur gbxra va vg
  vf arire frra nf n frperg, naq gur vachg pbzrf onpx hapunatrq.
- **Ergheavat `h.Fgevat()` nyjnlf.** `UGGCF://Fgnghf...` orpbzrf `uggcf://Fgnghf...`; unezyrff,
  ohg gur ERNQZR cebzvfrf gur vachg jura gurer vf abguvat gb uvqr, naq na bcrengbe pbzcnevat gur
  ybt yvar jvgu gur pbasvt jnagf gb frr jung jnf pbasvtherq.
- **Ergheavat `ree.Reebe()` be `enj` ba n cnefr reebe.** Obgu pbagnva gur cnffjbeq.
- **Er-rapbqvat gur dhrel jura bayl gur cnffjbeq punatrq.** Vg erbeqref cnenzrgref sbe ab
  ernfba, naq gur qvss orgjrra pbasvt naq ybt orpbzrf abvfr.

## Va cebqhpgvba

- **Glcrq frpergf ner gur svefg yvar, abg gur bayl bar.** Zbfg freivprf pbzovar: n frperg glcr va
  gur pbqr (guvf rkrepvfr); erqnpgvba bs xabja funcrf fhpu nf HEYf naq `Nhgubevmngvba` urnqref ng
  gur rqtrf; n fpnaare va gur ybt cvcryvar gung znfxf cnggreaf ng vatrfg (ybt iraqbef naq ntragf
  fhpu nf Irpgbe naq Syhrag Ovg bssre guvf); frperg fpnaavat ba gur ercbfvgbel (TvgUho frperg
  fpnaavat, tvgyrnxf); naq n snfg jnl gb ebgngr, orpnhfr fbzrguvat jvyy yrnx naljnl. Ebgngvba vf
  gur ynfg yvar bs qrsrapr, naq n grnz gung pna ebgngr va zvahgrf gerngf n yrnx nf n ebhgvar
  gnfx, abg nf n pevfvf.
- **Gur fgnaqneq yvoenel qbrf cneg bs guvf nyernql.** `HEY.Erqnpgrq` (Tb 1.15) ercynprf gur
  cnffjbeq jvgu `kkkkk`, gur fnzr znexre nf guvf rkrepvfr. `arg/uggc`'f pyvrag fgevcf gur cnffjbeq
  sebz gur HEY va gur reebef vg ergheaf, sbe gur fnzr ernfba gung `ErqnpgHEY` arire ergheaf gur
  `hey.Cnefr` reebe.
- **Qngnonfr qeviref.** Pbaarpgvba fgevatf ner gur pynffvp yrnx. Tbbq qeviref uvqr gur cnffjbeq va
  gurve bja cnefr reebef; purpx lbhef orsber lbh ybt vgf reebef. yvocd nyfb npprcgf gur xrljbeq
  sbez `ubfg=qo hfre=ncc cnffjbeq=k`, juvpu vf abg n HEY (fgergpu tbny).
- **Fvtarq HEYf.** N cerfvtarq qbjaybnq yvax vf n frperg sbe nf ybat nf vg vf inyvq. Nmher FNF
  gbxraf pneel gur fvtangher va `fvt`, juvpu vf jul vg vf ba gur yvfg; F3 cerfvtarq HEYf hfr
  `K-Nzm-Fvtangher` naq `K-Nzm-Perqragvny`, juvpu n cebqhpgvba yvfg nqqf.
- **Gur BJNFC Ybttvat Purng Furrg** yvfgf jung arire orybatf va n ybt: cnffjbeqf, npprff gbxraf,
  frffvba VQf, pbaarpgvba fgevatf, rapelcgvba xrlf. Vg vf n tbbq purpxyvfg sbe gur "rirel cngu"
  gnoyr bs fgrc 1.
- **Inhyg** unfurf frpergf va vgf nhqvg ybt jvgu na UZNP. Lbh pna fgvyy purpx jurgure 2 ybt yvarf
  pneel gur fnzr gbxra, jvgubhg nalobql orvat noyr gb ernq vg. Jura `[ERQNPGRQ]` uvqrf gbb zhpu
  sbe qrohttvat, gung vf gur arkg fgrc hc.

Arkg: 18-gnoyrcevag vf gur ernqvat fvqr bs `szg.Fgevatre`. Gurer lbh jevgr gur pbqr gung nfxf n
inyhr jurgure vg unf n `Fgevat` zrgubq, gur dhrfgvba `szg` nfxrq lbhe `Frperg` urer. 26-ybtszg
hfrf `Fgevat` sbe vgf yriryf. 31-raipbasvt ernqf pbasvt vagb n fgehpg guebhtu
